Output assets/tmux-deck-demo.gif

Set Shell "bash"
Set Width 1200
Set Height 720
Set FontSize 20
Set Framerate 30
Set TypingSpeed 40ms
Set Padding 14

Hide
Type "tmux-deck --config demo/config.toml --interval 200"
Enter
Show
Sleep 2s
Screenshot assets/tmux-deck-session-manager.png
Sleep 500ms

Down@250ms
Sleep 1200ms
Down@250ms
Sleep 1200ms
Tab
Sleep 500ms
Down@250ms
Sleep 1s
Tab
Sleep 500ms

Space
Sleep 120ms
Space
Sleep 1800ms
Left@250ms
Sleep 1200ms

Space
Sleep 120ms
Space
Sleep 800ms
Enter
Sleep 500ms

Hide
Type "tmux attach-session -t editor"
Enter
Show
Sleep 2s
